{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33161","headline":"赠王道士 · 司马扎","name":"赠王道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉洞秋有花，蓬山夜无鬼。\n岂知浮云世，生死逐流水。\n瑶台歌一曲，曲尽五烟起。\n悠然望虚路，玉京在海里。\n青籙秘不闻，黄鹤去不止。\n愿随执轻策，往结周太子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}